OL,3,GNEWSALost monastery masonry may have
OL,4,Abeen reused for hospital's drain
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurviving parts of a monastery set up
OL,7,Fby King James I of Scotland almost 470
OL,8,Fyears ago may have been found in an old
OL,9,Fdrain.
OL,11,FThe Charterhouse was established in
OL,12,FPerth for monks of the Carthusian
OL,13,FOrder, and at the heart of the complex
OL,14,Fwas a lavishly decorated church.
OL,16,FThe monastery was later demolished and
OL,17,Fover the centuries the medieval site
OL,18,Fdisappeared under a hospital and
OL,19,Fhouses.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
