OL,3,GNEWSALost monastery masonry may have
OL,4,Abeen reused for hospital's drain
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring an excavation last month,
OL,7,Farchaeologists and volunteers uncovered
OL,8,Fan 18th Century culvert that appeared
OL,9,Fto have been partly made using stone
OL,10,Ffrom the torn down monastery.
